{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0243","paragraphs":[{"id":"p41eb456b5e7c-1","text":"月皎惊乌栖不定。"},{"id":"p32c46820b261-1","text":"更漏将残，辘，牵金井。"},{"id":"p8ca9eee3d42a-1","text":"唤起两眸清炯炯。"},{"id":"pf036f9a17b7e-1","text":"泪花落枕红棉泠。"},{"id":"p99be82e2f7fc-1","text":"执手霜风吹鬓影。"},{"id":"p8e3f9707b71a-1","text":"去意徊徨，别语愁难听。"},{"id":"p94f20bca10fd-1","text":"楼上阑干横斗柄。"},{"id":"pe3bb8b3c4663-1","text":"露寒人远鸡相应。"}]}